1. Initialization: Create a town grid of size N x M initialized with empty plots (denoted by '.'). 
2. Place Buildings: Implement functionality to place buildings on specific plots. 
3. Validation: Ensure buildings are placed according to these rules: 
o Residential (R) cannot be adjacent to Industrial (I) 
